    "title": "Former Buncombe County pretrial employee arrested on felony obstruction charges - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WLOS Staff ,\n6 hours ago BUNCOMBE COUNTY, N.C. (WLOS) — A former Buncombe County pretrial services employee appeared in court today after a felony indictment. A grand jury charged Rasnelly Vargas,33, with two counts of obstruction of justice following an investigation by the North Carolina State Bureau of Investigation into the county’s pretrial services program. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
